      "cooked": "<p>Lets say i use Mass Levitions' power. Until Visionary's turn starts, enviorment targets do 3 less. Lets say a new enviroment target enters play while the effect still stands. Is it affected by ML?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>2) Enlightenment lets me have someone draw cards but i m must discard the revealed card. If I let NightMist draw the cards does that mean she still must discard the revealed card?</p>",
