      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/oaktree/{size}/2287_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-11-10T16:53:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>La Capitan's \"Boarding Party\" has cards revealed until a condition is met, some put into play and the rest discarded.&nbsp; \"A Motley Crew\" has the villain trash shuffled, cards revealed until a condition is met, some put in play and the rest put back into the trash.</p><p>So it seems that \"revealed\" is a sort of temporary limbo space; not in the deck, in play, or in the trash.</p>",
