      "created_at": "2013-11-10T21:10:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>One strange interaction that can occur is Urshe can reveal both Shamise and Rod of Anubis.</p><p>Urshe then puts Shamise into play, and Shamise promptly searches the deck and trash for Rod of Anubis, which is in neither, since it is curently revealed.</p><p>Then after all trials enter play Rod of Anubis is discarded.</p>",
